From 44c2c44e9cae38b286676b0bba682c0dffd45bfd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:08:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Add mfxu and the RH850 FXU instructions

Add the option for the FXU of the RH850 G4MH2 core with the 32 vector
registers, its SIMD instructions and its system register names.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
